  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YALI - Ngetich - Illuminum Greenhouses</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smallholder farmers in Kenyarely on rainwater togrow their crops. That is why Taita is utilizing greenhouses and drip irrigation to help these farmers expand their yield. Taitia is constructing greenhouses and providing trainings on modern farming methodologies for local farmers to help them maximize water usage and increase their production.</narrative>
  </description>
